<title>UK: London gold fixes lower, may test downside.</title>
<headline>London gold fixes lower, may test downside.</headline>
<text>
<p>GOLD - Fixed at $379.50 vs $380.35 previously. No follow through to Wednesday's short-covering rally. Fairly quiet so far but seen weakening if resistance over $380 holds.</p>
<p>SILVER - Quiet and barely changed at $4.91/$4.93.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Very quiet at $0.50 lower $383.75/$384.75.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - Touch firmer at $120.75/$121.75.</p>
</text>
